C R168 OL GOV-017,GOV-005 | MUST | Classify a decision by stating it and its options and applying CLAUDE.md decision classes: Decided follows the existing entry, Delegated is decided and proceeds, only Reserved decisions or changes to accepted ones continue in this workflow. | Decisions | none stated
